# Example 02 — RANDOM seed feeding DLIB:BFGS.
#
# What this exercises:
#   - INIT block — STRATEGY RANDOM K, SEED, INCLUDE_CONFIG.
#   - INCLUDE_CONFIG false: the explicit chain owns iter 0 (and here we
#     did not write CONFIG — the in-config value is dropped).
#
# DLIB:BFGS only consumes the first seed; the chain length therefore
# does not need to exceed 1. Compare with example 03 to see how
# MULTISTART consumes more.

OPTIMIZER
  INIT
    STRATEGY RANDOM 1
    INCLUDE_CONFIG false
    SEED 2026
  ENDINIT
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB DLIB
    ALGO BFGS
    MAXEVAL 6
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM RCUT2B (1) 4.0 6.0
OPTIM SGRIDMB (1) 0.1 0.4

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
